<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Premium Sales Solutions</title>

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            font-family: "Segoe UI", Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            color: #222;
            background: #f7f8fc;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: inherit;
        }

        .container {
            width: min(1180px, 92%);
            margin: auto;
        }

        /* ================= HEADER ================= */

        header {
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 1000;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.96);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            box-shadow: 0 2px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
        }

        .navbar {
            min-height: 75px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 30px;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 1.6rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #667eea;
        }

        .logo span {
            color: #764ba2;
        }

        nav {
            display: flex;
            gap: 28px;
            align-items: center;
        }

        nav a {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #444;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: #667eea;
        }

        .nav-btn {
            padding: 10px 20px;
            border-radius: 25px;
            color: white !important;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea, #764ba2);
        }

        /* ================= HERO ================= */

        .hero {
            min-height: 720px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            color: white;
            background:
                linear-gradient(rgba(35, 40, 100, 0.88), rgba(89, 47, 130, 0.9)),
                radial-gradient(circle at top right, #8b9aff, #5d3a88);
        }

        .hero-content {
            max-width: 760px;
        }

        .badge {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 8px 18px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
            border-radius: 30px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: clamp(2.7rem, 6vw, 5rem);
            line-height: 1.08;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .hero h1 span {
            color: #d9dcff;
        }

        .hero p {
            max-width: 680px;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            opacity: 0.92;
            margin-bottom: 35px;
        }

        .hero-buttons {
            display: flex;
            gap: 15px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 14px 27px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            font-weight: 700;
            transition: 0.3s;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            color: #5d3a88;
            background: white;
        }

        .btn-primary:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
        }

        .btn-outline {
            color: white;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
            background: transparent;
        }

        .btn-outline:hover {
            background: white;
            color: #5d3a88;
        }

        /* ================= STATS ================= */

        .stats {
            margin-top: -70px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 5;
        }

        .stats-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            background: white;
            border-radius: 18px;
            box-shadow: 0 15px 45px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .stat {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 35px 20px;
            border-right: 1px solid #eee;
        }

        .stat:last-child {
            border-right: none;
        }

        .stat h2 {
            color: #667eea;
            font-size: 2rem;
        }

        .stat p {
            color: #777;
            margin-top: 5px;
        }

        /* ================= SECTIONS ================= */

        section {
            padding: 100px 0;
        }

        .section-title {
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 0 auto 55px;
        }

        .section-title .small-title {
            color: #667eea;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
        }

        .section-title h2 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin: 10px 0 15px;
            color: #222;
        }

        .section-title p {
            color: #777;
        }

        /* ================= ABOUT ================= */

        .about {
            background: white;
        }

        .about-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 60px;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .about-content h2 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .about-content p {
            color: #666;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }

        .about-list {
            margin-top: 25px;
            list-style: none;
        }

        .about-list li {
            margin-bottom: 13px;
            color: #444;
        }

        .about-list li::before {
            content: "✓";
            color: #667eea;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-right: 12px;
        }

        .about-card {
            padding: 45px;
            border-radius: 25px;
            color: white;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea, #764ba2);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(102,126,234,0.25);
        }

        .about-card h3 {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .about-card p {
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        /* ================= SERVICES ================= */

        .services {
            background: #f7f8fc;
        }

        .services-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 25px;
        }

        .service-card {
            background: white;
            padding: 35px 28px;
            border-radius: 18px;
            border: 1px solid #eee;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .service-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-8px);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }

        .service-icon {
            width: 60px;
            height: 60px;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            border-radius: 15px;
            color: white;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea, #764ba2);
        }

        .service-card h3 {
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            font-size: 1.25rem;
        }

        .service-card p {
            color: #777;
        }

        /* ================= PROCESS ================= */

        .process {
            background: white;
        }

        .process-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: 25px;
        }

        .process-card {
            position: relative;
            padding: 30px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .process-number {
            width: 65px;
            height: 65px;
            margin: auto auto 20px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            color: white;
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea, #764ba2);
        }

        .process-card h3 {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .process-card p {
            color: #777;
        }

        /* ================= SOLUTIONS ================= */

        .solutions {
            background: #f7f8fc;
        }

        .solution-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 25px;
        }

        .solution-box {
            padding: 35px;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 18px;
            border-left: 5px solid #667eea;
        }

        .solution-box h3 {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .solution-box p {
            color: #777;
        }

        /* ================= TESTIMONIALS ================= */

        .testimonials {
            background: white;
        }

        .testimonial-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 25px;
        }

        .testimonial {
            padding: 30px;
            background: #f8f9ff;
            border-radius: 18px;
        }

        .stars {
            color: #f5b301;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
        }

        .testimonial p {
            color: #666;
            font-style: italic;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .client {
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #333;
        }

        .client span {
            display: block;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: normal;
            color: #888;
        }

        /* ================= PRICING ================= */

        .pricing {
            background: #f7f8fc;
        }

        .pricing-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 25px;
            align-items: stretch;
        }

        .price-card {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 40px 30px;
            border: 1px solid #eee;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .price-card.featured {
            color: white;
            transform: scale(1.04);
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea, #764ba2);
            border: none;
        }

        .price-card h3 {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .price {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .price-card ul {
            list-style: none;
            text-align: left;
            margin: 25px 0;
        }

        .price-card li {
            margin: 12px 0;
        }

        .price-card li::before {
            content: "✓";
            margin-right: 10px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .price-card .btn {
            width: 100%;
        }

        .price-card:not(.featured) .btn {
            color: white;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea, #764ba2);
        }

        /* ================= CTA ================= */

        .cta {
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea, #764ba2);
        }

        .cta h2 {
            font-size: 2.8rem;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .cta p {
            max-width: 650px;
            margin: 0 auto 30px;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        /* ================= CONTACT ================= */

        .contact {
            background: white;
        }

        .contact-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 0.8fr 1.2fr;
            gap: 50px;
        }

        .contact-info h2 {
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .contact-info > p {
            color: #777;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .contact-item {
            display: flex;
            gap: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .contact-icon {
            width: 45px;
            height: 45px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            border-radius: 10px;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            color: white;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea, #764ba2);
        }

        .contact-item strong {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 3px;
        }

        .contact-item span {
            color: #777;
        }

        form {
            background: #f8f9ff;
            padding: 35px;
            border-radius: 20px;
        }

        .form-row {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 15px;
        }

        .form-group {
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }

        label {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 7px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #444;
        }

        input,
        textarea,
        select {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 13px 15px;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font: inherit;
            outline: none;
            background: white;
        }

        input:focus,
        textarea:focus,
        select:focus {
            border-color: #667eea;
        }

        textarea {
            min-height: 130px;
            resize: vertical;
        }

        form .btn {
            width: 100%;
            color: white;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea, #764ba2);
        }

        /* ================= FAQ ================= */

        .faq {
            background: #f7f8fc;
        }

        .faq-container {
            max-width: 850px;
            margin: auto;
        }

        details {
            background: white;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 20px 25px;
            border: 1px solid #eee;
        }

        summary {
            cursor: pointer;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #333;
        }

        details p {
            color: #777;
            padding-top: 15px;
        }

        /* ================= FOOTER ================= */

        footer {
            color: white;
            background: #17172b;
            padding: 60px 0 25px;
        }

        .footer-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 40px;
            margin-bottom: 45px;
        }

        .footer-brand h2 {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .footer-brand p {
            color: #aaa;
            max-width: 330px;
        }

        footer h3 {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        footer ul {
            list-style: none;
        }

        footer li {
            margin: 9px 0;
            color: #aaa;
        }

        footer li a:hover {
            color: white;
        }

        .copyright {
            padding-top: 25px;
            border-top: 1px solid #333;
            text-align: center;
            color: #888;
        }

        /* ================= RESPONSIVE ================= */

        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            nav {
                display: none;
            }

            .stats-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            }

            .stat:nth-child(2) {
                border-right: none;
            }

            .about-grid,
            .contact-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .services-grid,
            .testimonial-grid,
            .pricing-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            }

            .process-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            }

            .footer-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            section {
                padding: 70px 0;
            }

            .hero {
                min-height: 650px;
            }

            .hero h1 {
                font-size: 2.7rem;
            }

            .stats-grid,
            .services-grid,
            .process-grid,
            .solution-grid,
            .testimonial-grid,
            .pricing-grid,
            .footer-grid,
            .form-row {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .stat {
                border-right: none;
                border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;
            }

            .stat:last-child {
                border-bottom: none;
            }

            .section-title h2,
            .cta h2 {
                font-size: 2rem;
            }

            .price-card.featured {
                transform: none;
            }

            .about-card {
                padding: 30px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <!-- ================= NAVIGATION ================= -->

    <header>
        <div class="container navbar">
            <a href="#home" class="logo">Sales<span>Pro</span></a>

            <nav>
                <a href="#home">Home</a>
                <a href="#about">About</a>
                <a href="#services">Services</a>
                <a href="#process">Process</a>
                <a href="#pricing">Pricing</a>
                <a href="#contact" class="nav-btn">Contact Us</a>
            </nav>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- ================= HERO ================= -->

    <section class="hero" id="home">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="hero-content">

                <span class="badge">SMARTER SALES • STRONGER BUSINESS</span>

                <h1>
                    Turn More Leads Into
                    <span>Long-Term Customers.</span>
                </h1>

                <p>
                    We help ambitious businesses build powerful sales systems,
                    improve team performance, generate qualified leads and create
                    predictable revenue through modern sales strategies.
                </p>

                <div class="hero-buttons">
                    <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary">Start Growing</a>
                    <a href="#services" class="btn btn-outline">Explore Services</a>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ================= STATS ================= -->

    <div class="stats">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="stats-grid">

                <div class="stat">
                    <h2>500+</h2>
                    <p>Businesses Supported</p>
                </div>

                <div class="stat">
                    <h2>92%</h2>
                    <p>Client Satisfaction</p>
                </div>

                <div class="stat">
                    <h2>3.5X</h2>
                    <p>Average ROI Growth</p>
                </div>

                <div class="stat">
                    <h2>10+</h2>
                    <p>Years Experience</p>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ================= ABOUT ================= -->

    <section class="about" id="about">
        <div class="container">

            <div class="section-title">
                <div class="small-title">Who We Are</div>
                <h2>Now Your Growth Is Our Business</h2>
                <p>
                    A modern sales partner focused on sustainable revenue,
                    customer relationships and measurable business growth.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="about-grid">

                <div class="about-content">

                    <h2>Building Sales Systems That Actually Work</h2>

                    <p>
                        SalesPro is a results-driven sales consultancy designed
                        to help businesses overcome common sales challenges and
                        unlock new revenue opportunities.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        From lead generation and sales strategy to customer
                        retention and performance analytics, our team works
                        alongside you to create a complete sales ecosystem.
                    </p>

                    <ul class="about-list">
                        <li>Customized sales strategies</li>
                        <li>Experienced sales consultants</li>
                        <li>Data-driven decision making</li>
                        <li>Transparent performance reporting</li>
                        <li>Long-term customer success</li>
                    </ul>

                </div>

                <div class="about-card">
                    <h3>Why Choose SalesPro?</h3>

                    <p>
                        We don't believe in one-size-fits-all sales solutions.
                        Every business has different customers, products,
                        markets and goals. That's why we create customized
                        strategies based on your actual business environment.
                    </p>

                    <br>

                    <p>
                        Our goal is simple: help your team sell more efficiently,
                        serve customers better and create predictable revenue.
                    </p>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ================= SERVICES ================= -->

    <section class="services" id="services">
        <div class="container">

            <div class="section-title">
                <div class="small-title">Our Services</div>
                <h2>Complete Sales Solutions</h2>
                <p>
                    Everything your business needs to build a high-performing
                    sales operation.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="services-grid">

                <div class="service-card">
                    <div class="service-icon">📈</div>
                    <h3>Sales Strategy</h3>
                    <p>
                        Develop a clear sales roadmap with defined targets,
                        market positioning, customer segments and growth goals.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="service-card">
                    <div class="service-icon">🎯</div>
                    <h3>Lead Generation</h3>
                    <p>
                        Identify and attract qualified prospects using
                        targeted acquisition and lead nurturing strategies.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="service-card">
                    <div class="service-icon">👥</div>
                    <h3>Sales Training</h3>
                    <p>
                        Improve your team's communication, negotiation,
                        prospecting, objection handling and closing skills.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="service-card">
                    <div class="service-icon">📊</div>
                    <h3>Sales Analytics</h3>
                    <p>
                        Transform sales data into actionable insights and
                        understand exactly where revenue opportunities exist.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="service-card">
                    <div class="service-icon">💰</div>
                    <h3>Revenue Optimization</h3>
                    <p>
                        Improve pricing, conversion rates, sales processes and
                        customer value to maximize revenue potential.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="service-card">
                    <div class="service-icon">🤝</div>
                    <h3>Customer Success</h3>
                    <p>
                        Build stronger post-sale relationships that increase
                        retention, referrals and customer lifetime value.
                    </p>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ================= PROCESS ================= -->

    <section class="process" id="process">
        <div class="container">

            <div class="section-title">
                <div class="small-title">Our Process</div>
                <h2>How We Grow Your Sales</h2>
                <p>
                    A simple, transparent and measurable approach to improving
                    your sales performance.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="process-grid">

                <div class="process-card">
                    <div class="process-number">01</div>
                    <h3>Discover</h3>
                    <p>
                        We understand your business, customers, competitors
                        and current sales challenges.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="process-card">
                    <div class="process-number">02</div>
                    <h3>Plan</h3>
                    <p>
                        We create a customized sales strategy based on your
                        business objectives.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="process-card">
                    <div class="process-number">03</div>
                    <h3>Execute</h3>
                    <p>
                        Our team helps implement practical sales systems,
                        processes and campaigns.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="process-card">
                    <div class="process-number">04</div>
                    <h3>Optimize</h3>
                    <p>
                        We continuously measure results and improve your
                        sales process for stronger performance.
                    </p>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ================= SOLUTIONS ================= -->

    <section class="solutions">
        <div class="container">

            <div class="section-title">
                <div class="small-title">Business Solutions</div>
                <h2>Designed Around Your Goals</h2>
                <p>
                    Whether you are launching, expanding or optimizing,
                    our sales solutions adapt to your business stage.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="solution-grid">

                <div class="solution-box">
                    <h3>For Startups</h3>
                    <p>
                        Build your first repeatable sales process, identify
                        ideal customers and establish a strong foundation
                        for scalable growth.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="solution-box">
                    <h3>For Growing Businesses</h3>
                    <p>
                        Increase qualified leads, improve conversion rates
                        and build a stronger sales team as your company grows.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="solution-box">
                    <h3>For Established Companies</h3>
                    <p>
                        Optimize existing sales operations, discover new
                        revenue channels and improve customer retention.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="solution-box">
                    <h3>For Sales Teams</h3>
                    <p>
                        Improve productivity through coaching, performance
                        measurement, better sales tools and proven techniques.
                    </p>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ================= TESTIMONIALS ================= -->

    <section class="testimonials">
        <div class="container">

            <div class="section-title">
                <div class="small-title">Client Stories</div>
                <h2>What Our Clients Say</h2>
                <p>
                    Businesses trust our approach because we focus on
                    measurable outcomes and lasting partnerships.
                </p>
